		<a href="/" class="back-link">← Back to Calculator</a>
		<h1>How GridPermit Works</h1>
		<p>GridPermit is an independent educational website designed to help US homeowners explore preliminary residential solar and battery storage estimates in about 30 seconds.</p>

		<h2>1. Enter Baseline Energy Inputs</h2>
		<p>You provide your 5-digit US ZIP code and average monthly electric spend. GridPermit does not require personal contact information to generate estimates.</p>

		<h2>2. Instant Educational Modeling</h2>
		<p>Our tool models potential system sizing (kW), energy storage capacities (kWh), and preliminary payback timelines using regional electricity rate averages and standardized yield assumptions.</p>

		<h2>3. Compare Independent Marketplace Quotes</h2>
		<p>When you are ready to evaluate property-specific engineering, equipment, and final installer pricing, click outbound links to request free quotes through our independent partner marketplace.</p>
